WEBVTT

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.097
I was furious.

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:34.930
And then, shortly thereafter,

00:05:34.963 --> 00:05:37.130
unexpectedly, he died ...

00:05:38.497 --> 00:05:40.997
right before I graduated from MIT.

00:05:42.163 --> 00:05:43.663
It upended my life.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:48.830
But there was a silver lining
that felt slightly cosmic.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:51.763
He left me a little bit of money

00:05:51.797 --> 00:05:55.697
that allowed me to step off
the academic path

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.130
and try my own thing.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.297
I poured myself into work,

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.597
churning out videos day and night.